Graphify Explorer
=================

This project is a desktop GUI wrapper. It does not implement any graph
extraction, clustering, query, or visualization itself - all of that is
provided by the upstream `graphifyy` package, which is the work of:

    Safi Shamsi
    https://github.com/safishamsi
    https://github.com/safishamsi/graphify
    https://pypi.org/project/graphifyy/

`graphifyy` is installed as a runtime dependency by the OS-specific
installer scripts (`Install-Windows.bat`, `Install-macOS.command`,
`install-linux.sh`). It is not redistributed by this project.

If you find Graphify Explorer useful, the credit for the underlying graph
engine belongs upstream. Please consider starring the upstream repository.

